Package: haiti
Version: 4.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: ruby
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/noraj/haiti
Description: Hash type identifier (CLI tool)
 haiti (Hash Type Identifier) is a command-line tool that identifies
 the type of a given hash using a large database of hash formats.
 It supports over 500 hash types and can also identify multiple
 hash formats from a single input.
